Package: sediros-base-files
Version: 1:@SEDIROS_RELEASE@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: The SedirOS Authors <ahmetatakan.tech@gmail.com>
Section: admin
Priority: required
Depends: base-files
Description: SedirOS release identification
 Identifies the system as SedirOS @SEDIROS_RELEASE@ (based on Debian
 @SEDIROS_DEBIAN@ @SEDIROS_CODENAME@) through /usr/lib/os-release.
 ID_LIKE=debian keeps tools that look for Debian working.
 .
 Debian's os-release is kept as /usr/lib/os-release.debian (dpkg-divert)
 and restored when this package is removed.
 .
 The epoch (1:) orders SedirOS 1.0 after the 13.1 release candidates.
